  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\nPair: ⟦{狭|せば}める→狭める：07611_sebameru⟧ (transitive - to narrow something)\nPattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{狭|せば}まる\n\nRELATION TO {狭|せま}い:\n{狭|せば}まる is the verb form derived from ⟦{狭|せま}い→狭い：00750_semai⟧ (narrow). Note the consonant change: せま→せば.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{狭|せば}まって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ - has narrowed (resultant state)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{視野|しや}→視野：08659_shiya⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{狭|せば}まる - one's perspective narrows\n- ⟦{範囲|はんい}→範囲：03567_hani⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{狭|せば}まる - the range narrows\n- ⟦{可能性|かのうせい}→可能性：04818_kanousei⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{狭|せば}まる - possibilities narrow\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used metaphorically for options, possibilities, or scope being reduced.",
